---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who I am and why this site exists.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="title">About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Replace this with your story.</strong> A good about page answers three questions: who are you, what do you make, and why should a stranger care?</p>
      <p>Here’s a starting draft. I spend my days writing software and the rest of my time following whatever has caught my curiosity: a book, a climb, a side project, an idea I can’t shake. When I’m not at a keyboard I’m usually on a bike, riding hills and thinking.</p>
      <h2>Why “Mind of KV”</h2>
      <p>Because it’s deliberately broad. I don’t want to be the “X person.” This is wherever my curiosity goes next, held together by one habit: I write down what I find.</p>
      <h2>Say hello</h2>
      <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, reply to any newsletter, or find me on {SITE.socials.map((s, i) => <>{i > 0 && (i === SITE.socials.length - 1 ? ' or ' : ', ')}<a href={s.href}>{s.label}</a></>)}.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
